{
    "title": "Survival maps for Minecraft PE",
    "description": "With this application, you can install maps for Minecraft Pocket Edition in one click.\r\n8 maps for minecraft pe are currently available in the application:\r\n\r\nOne Block survival\r\nPirate island\r\nFloor is lava: island survival\r\nSpace adventure map for Minecraft\r\nDungeon \r\nAmong Us map \r\nCube block survival\r\n\r\nOne block Survival: You find yourself on a small flying island that's not 1 block. There is a tree and a chest on the island. With all this you have to survive.\r\n\r\nPirate island survival: seeds for minecraft, where you find yourself on an island in the middle of an ocean. Treasures are hidden on the island, as well as an abandoned ship.\r\n\r\nFloor is lava: island survival. Hardcore map for mpce. You find yourself on a small island surrounded on all sides by lava. \r\n\r\nSky survival: survival map for minecraft. Just one block and a void.  \r\n\r\nAmong us map: two players will be selected the role of impostors. But you won't know who it is. Vote and look for impostors to survive. This map has been created for MCPE.\r\n\r\nApp features: \r\n1-Click installer\r\nYou can install maps for free\r\nSimple user interface\r\nMaps and addons have descriptions, screenshots and activation guide\r\nFor boys and girls \r\nSupport version 1.14 & 1.16\r\n\r\nSimple install maps for Minecraft PE.\r\n\r\nTo install maps you need Minecraft: pocket edition.\r\n\r\nThis product is not an official installation for Minecraft Pocket Edition. We are not an associated firm of Mojang AB and have never cooperated with this enterprise. Minecraft Name, Brand, and other relative assets belong to the Mojang AB Company or their official owner. All rights reserved as indicated in https://www.minecraft.net/usage-guidelines",
